ck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464750/extras/cards.gif?t=1746461263\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support for smooth, immersive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run-based progression with endless replayability. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete for the top spot on the global leaderboard.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464750/extras/CARD-steam_description_header-dynamic-english.png?t=1746461263\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your cards wisely! With hundreds of unlockable cards, every run presents new opportunities. Synergize your picks to maximize efficiency and control the battlefield. Combine two cards of the same quality to receive a random, more powerful card, and reshape your strategy mid-run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't passive tower defense. Deploy tower and unit cards to establish your defenses in real time. Use item cards to gain ongoing effects, power cards for instant impact, and active cards to shift the tide in your favor. Every choice matters, and your survival depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464750/extras/playing.gif?t=1746461263\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464750/extras/CARD-steam_description_header-replayability-english.png?t=1746461263\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every session is different, thanks to procedural card variety, evolving tactics, and escalating challenges. Hone your skills, chase new strategies, and climb the <strong>world leaderboard</strong> with each new run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464750/extras/CARD-steam_description_header-controller-english.png?t=1746461263\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play your way! Whether you're using a controller or mouse and keyboard, <i>Cards and Towers</i> supports your preferred input. Designed for comfort and precision, so you can stay focused on the strategy.</p>","developers":["Family Devs"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464750/7bb1a5731e9a260b816c9f12fcd021d2f149f1bc/header.jpg?t=1746461263","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Family Devs & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134025,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134025/movie480.mp4?t=1746461257","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134025/movie_max.mp4?t=1746461257"},"name":"Steam Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134025/e5e807a574e81fa6373dfb5a6defaeb38d605943/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746461257","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134025/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746461257","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134025/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746461257"}}],"name":"Cards and Towers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 4 processor or later that's SSE2 capable<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["indie.io"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rat